/* ===== USAGE NOTES ===== */

/*
1. STICKY POSITIONING: Navbar stays at top while scrolling
2. GLASS EFFECT: Blurs content behind it as page scrolls
3. MOBILE MENU: Hamburger icon appears below 768px width
4. HOVER ANIMATION: Links show underline on hover (desktop only)
5. CTA BUTTON: Last item can be a button for call-to-action
6. LOGO/ICON: Add SVG or image inside .hq-glass-navbar-brand
7. MAX WIDTH: Container maxes at 1400px, change if needed
8. ACCESSIBILITY: Toggle button has aria-label for screen readers

CUSTOMIZATION TIPS:
- Change breakpoint: Modify @media (max-width: 768px) to your preferred width
- Add more links: Just add more <li> items in the menu
- Change accent color: Modify --accent-primary variable
- Remove button: Delete the <li><button> element if not needed
*/